@startuml
title Local RAG Architecture Flow - Black London Collection

actor User as "Researcher / User"
participant UI as "Frontend (index.html)"
participant Backend as "Middleware (FastAPI / backend.py)"
database Chroma as "Vector DB (ChromaDB)"
participant Ollama as "Local LLM (Ollama - Llama 3.1)"
participant Media as "Local Media & Captions"

== Offline Indexing Pipeline (One-off / Build phase) ==
note over Media, Chroma
  1. OpenAI Whisper processes local MP4 reels -> outputs JSON transcripts + start/end seconds
  2. build_index.py loads transcripts -> chunks text -> embeds via all-MiniLM-L6-v2
  3. json_to_vtt.py converts JSON -> WebVTT subtitle files
end note

== Query Execution Flow ==
User -> UI : Inputs query ("What does Fela Kuti think of Afrobeat?")
activate UI

UI -> Backend : POST /ask {"question": "..."}
activate Backend

Backend -> Chroma : Query collection for top 3 relevant chunks
activate Chroma
Chroma --> Backend : Return transcript chunks + metadata (filename, start_time)
deactivate Chroma

Backend -> Ollama : Prompt LLM (Strict anti-hallucination instruction + retrieved context)
activate Ollama
Ollama --> Backend : Return synthesized textual answer
deactivate Ollama

Backend --> UI : Respond HTTP 200 JSON {answer, citations: [{filename, time}]}
deactivate Backend

UI -> User : Display AI Answer + ▶ Play Evidence Button
deactivate UI

== Media Navigation & Synchronisation ==
User -> UI : Clicks "▶ Play Evidence (BL_009 @ 1752s)"
activate UI

UI -> Media : Load vimeo_downloads/BLACKLIVES_BL_009.mp4
UI -> Media : Load synchronized captions transcripts/BLACKLIVES_BL_009.vtt
Media --> UI : Media Metadata Loaded

UI -> Media : Jump video currentTime to 1752s & trigger play()
UI --> User : Synchronized video playback with WebVTT captions
deactivate UI

@enduml
